//@version=6
// =====================================================================
//  HALAL / HARAM STOCK INDICATOR
//  Shows Shariah-compliance status on the chart and as a screener filter.
//  Data source: HalalScreener API (AAOIFI standard).
//  Status codes:  2 = Halal (green)  1 = Questionable (yellow)  0 = Haram (red)
// =====================================================================
indicator("Halal Screener", shorttitle="Halal?", overlay=true)

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0. SETTINGS
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
showGrade = input.bool(true, "Show grade (A+, C+, F)")

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. DATA  -- paste the auto-generated arrays from halal_pine_data.txt
//    HERE, replacing the small sample below.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// ====== AUTO-GENERATED HALAL DATA (3133 tickers) ======
// Source: HalalScreener API.  Regenerate monthly.
// Data is wrapped in functions to keep the main script body small.
// 2 = halal, 1 = doubtful, 0 = haram.

